        "Screening done (the neck and its signs, hot and damaged joints, the heart and falls), the first measurement recorded, the DAS28 band from the doctor and the pathway chosen, and referrals for splints and foot orthoses sent; the person knows the symptom rule, the flare-day routine and joint protection, and has started light aerobic work, strengthening at 40–50%, the hand programme and its diary.",
